flowchart LR
  Start([用户请求图表]):::input --> Generate[生成 .mmd 源码]:::process
  Generate --> Local{本地 mmdc 可用?}:::decision
  Local -->|是| Validate[使用临时 SVG 校验]:::process
  Local -->|否| Container{本地 CLI 容器可用?}:::decision
  Container -->|是| Validate
  Container -->|否| Kroki{回环 Kroki 可用?}:::decision
  Kroki -->|是| Validate
  Kroki -->|否| Unvalidated([报告源码未校验]):::warning
  Validate --> Result{语法有效?}:::decision
  Result -->|否| Fix[修复 .mmd 源码]:::warning
  Fix --> Validate
  Result -->|是| Export{明确要求格式?}:::decision
  Export -->|否| Source([报告已校验 .mmd]):::output
  Export -->|是| Render[仅导出指定格式]:::process
  Render --> Review[检查所请求的产物]:::process
  Review --> Report([报告输出路径]):::output

  classDef input fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745,color:#155724
  classDef process fill:#cce5ff,stroke:#007bff,color:#004085
  classDef decision fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#ffc107,color:#856404
  classDef warning fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#dc3545,color:#721c24
  classDef output fill:#e2d5f1,stroke:#6f42c1,color:#4a235a
